      "omegaBannerUrl": "",
      "readmeExcerpt": "# FFXIV Login Commands\n<a href=\"https://github.com/AEBus/FFXIV-Login-Commands/\"><img alt=\"FFXIV Login Commands\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/dynamic/json?url=https%3A%2F%2Fraw.githubusercontent.com%2FAEBus%2FFFXIV-Login-Commands%2Frefs%2Fheads%2Fmaster%2Frepo.json&query=%24.%5B0%5D.AssemblyVersion&label=FFXIV%20Login%20Commands\"></a>\n\nRun chat commands automatically when a character logs in. Supports per-character profiles,\nglobal commands, delays, ordering, and execution logs.\n\n- [Installation](#installation)\n- [Releases](https://github.com/AEBus/FFXIV-Login-Commands/releases)\n\n## Installation\nFFXIV Login Commands is a Dalamud plugin and requires FFXIVQuickLauncher to start the game.\n\n1. Type `/xlsettings` in chat to open Dalamud Settings.\n2. Open the \"Experimental\" tab and scroll to \"Custom Plugin Repositories\".\n3. Paste the repo URL below and press the \"+\" button.\n4. Press \"Save and Close\".\n5. Open `/xlplugins`, search for FFXIV Login Commands, and click install.\n\nRepo URL\n\n```\nhttps://raw.githubusercontent.com/AEBus/FFXIV-Login-Commands/master/repo.json\n```",
      "title": "FFXIV-Login-Commands",
      "url": "https://github.com/AEBus/FFXIV-Login-Commands"
    }
